    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a future where humanity has colonized the solar system, you join Norton - an AI entity manifested as a cat - on a mission to create the ultimate autopilot. Your daring maneuvers become training data for safeguarding future pilots, all while exploring worlds that blur the line between technology and imagination.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795160/extras/d089c6db5dbcd8777ff5ffd1c5f566b0.poster.avif?t=1747918209\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795160/extras/d089c6db5dbcd8777ff5ffd1c5f566b0.webm?t=1747918209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795160/extras/d089c6db5dbcd8777ff5ffd1c5f566b0.mp4?t=1747918209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score points through dangerous flying - the riskier the stunt, the higher the score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master realistic flight physics that account for each aircraft's unique properties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore semi-procedurally generated courses across technological dreamscapes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795160/extras/1d3e78841323abd51cbbf4422b6a4b3e.poster.avif?t=1747918209\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795160/extras/1d3e78841323abd51cbbf4422b6a4b3e.webm?t=1747918209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795160/extras/1d3e78841323abd51cbbf4422b6a4b3e.mp4?t=1747918209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 unique aircraft with distinct flight characteristics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 surreal levels inspired by computer components (fly through flooded motherboards and sound cards on a moon!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full modding support with detailed flight model documentation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounters with fantastical creatures and dangerous hazards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795160/extras/c8d07b74db6a191893314423157c5bf4.poster.avif?t=1747918209\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795160/extras/c8d07b74db6a191893314423157c5bf4.webm?t=1747918209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795160/extras/c8d07b74db6a191893314423157c5bf4.mp4?t=1747918209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Technical Details</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo developed by a licensed pilot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller &amp; joystick support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed modding &amp; flight model documentation available at exosky.aero</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795160/extras/03e4ef52a6be015a7100b96b3b26cc63.poster.avif?t=1747918209\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795160/extras/03e4ef52a6be015a7100b96b3b26cc63.webm?t=1747918209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795160/extras/03e4ef52a6be015a7100b96b3b26cc63.mp4?t=1747918209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a future where humanity has colonized the solar system, you join Norton - an AI entity manifested as a cat - on a mission to create the ultimate autopilot. Your daring maneuvers become training data for safeguarding future pilots, all while exploring worlds that blur the line between technology and imagination.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795160/extras/d089c6db5dbcd8777ff5ffd1c5f566b0.poster.avif?t=1747918209\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795160/extras/d089c6db5dbcd8777ff5ffd1c5f566b0.webm?t=1747918209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795160/extras/d089c6db5dbcd8777ff5ffd1c5f566b0.mp4?t=1747918209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score points through dangerous flying - the riskier the stunt, the higher the score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master realistic flight physics that account for each aircraft's unique properties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore semi-procedurally generated courses across technological dreamscapes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795160/extras/1d3e78841323abd51cbbf4422b6a4b3e.poster.avif?t=1747918209\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795160/extras/1d3e78841323abd51cbbf4422b6a4b3e.webm?t=1747918209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795160/extras/1d3e78841323abd51cbbf4422b6a4b3e.mp4?t=1747918209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 unique aircraft with distinct flight characteristics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 surreal levels inspired by computer components (fly through flooded motherboards and sound cards on a moon!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full modding support with detailed flight model documentation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounters with fantastical creatures and dangerous hazards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795160/extras/c8d07b74db6a191893314423157c5bf4.poster.avif?t=1747918209\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795160/extras/c8d07b74db6a191893314423157c5bf4.webm?t=1747918209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795160/extras/c8d07b74db6a191893314423157c5bf4.mp4?t=1747918209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Technical Details</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo developed by a licensed pilot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller &amp; joystick support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed modding &amp; flight model documentation available at exosky.aero</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795160/extras/03e4ef52a6be015a7100b96b3b26cc63.poster.avif?t=1747918209\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795160/extras/03e4ef52a6be015a7100b96b3b26cc63.webm?t=1747918209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795160/extras/03e4ef52a6be015a7100b96b3b26cc63.mp4?t=1747918209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
